00:00:26.529 --> 00:00:32.010
What were going to talk about here today is
the sort of bullet points here.

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:34.100
What are the variation services APIs?

00:00:34.100 --> 00:00:39.600
We are going to talk about the variant model
these APIs use.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.630
It is called SPDI.

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:46.089
I will spend a few minutes talking about that.

00:00:46.089 --> 00:00:47.090
Explaining how that works.

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:51.550
Were going to talk about some applications
