00:00:51.550 --> 00:00:53.450
I will show you what you can do with it.

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.530
I will show you an example where you can see
them in action here.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.720
How they work behind the scenes here.

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:03.370
I will show you a couple of interfaces that
you can go to to sort of test them out.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:08.400
To play around with them to see how the things
work, to show you what kinds of results you

00:01:08.400 --> 00:01:09.400
are going to get back.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:14.110
And then I will do some live practice, using
