https://api.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/variation/v0/hgvs/NM_000041.3:c.388T&gt;C/contextuals
https://api.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/variation/v0/vcf/11/5248224/A/AC/contextuals?assembly=GCF_000001405.25

